<div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;color:#F1EFE8">Most certificates cannot be checked. Here is how to check one.</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#F1EFE8"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:28px 12px">
