:#3973B0;padding-bottom:8px">Then keep this</div><div style="font:400 21px/1.25 Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;color:#0F1B2D;padding-bottom:8px">Five red flags in any peptide COA</div><div style="font:14px/1.65 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#5E6877;padding-bottom:12px">What to look for on reports from any seller, and the five-minute check to run before you buy.</div><a href="https://vantixbio.com/blog/5-red-flags-fake-peptide-coas.html?utm_source=email&utm_medium=retention&utm_campaign=welcome-d3" style="font:600 14px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#3973B0;text-decoration:none">See the red flags &rarr;</a></td></tr></table><p style="margin:0 0 16px;font:16px/1.7 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#243247"><span style="color:#5E6877;font-size:14px">When you are ready to order: orders typically ship within one business day, most arrive within about a week, and your first-order code <strong>WELCOME15</strong> takes 15% off. Questions about a report? Reply and ask.</span></p><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:6px 0 6px"><tr><td style="font:14px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif"><a href="https://vantixbio.com/verify.html?utm_source=email&utm_medium=retention&utm_campaign=welcome-d3" style="color:#3973B0">Open the verification portal</a> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <a href="https://vantixbio.com/shop.html?utm_source=email&utm_medium=retention&utm_campaign=welcome-d3" style="color:#3973B0">Visit the shop</a></td></tr></table>
